  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Disney films feature some of the most "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "adorable",
      "ref": "v-adorable"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " animal characters. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b1",
      "number": 1
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " so many people want to see their favourite furry friends turned into colourful "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "animated",
      "ref": "v-animated"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " creatures."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Isa Bredt, an artist from the Netherlands, makes it possible. She turns pet "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b2",
      "number": 2
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " into Disney-style cartoons. The characters she creates seem like they could jump right out of a classic Disney film!"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Bredt calls her project Pet Disneyfication. “I started because I was and still am a big "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b3",
      "number": 3
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of both drawing animals and the old Disney style,” said the 25-year-old. “"
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "The Lion King"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " is my all-time favourite movie. I used to watch it daily as a child. I also enjoyed watching "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Lady and the Tramp"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "101 Dalmatian"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " and "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "The Aristocats"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " when I was young.”"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Isa has been drawing since she was a child. When she was 16, she started "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b4",
      "number": 4
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " her work online. In the beginning, she offered free drawings to people who sent her pictures of their pets to "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b5",
      "number": 5
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " the style. The more she drew, the better she got. Now, she takes on "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "commissions",
      "zh": "委托"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " from around the world."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The Dutch artist also works her magic to "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b6",
      "number": 6
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " homeless animals. She turns them into lovable cartoon characters with the hope of increasing their chances of "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b7",
      "number": 7
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " loving homes."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Opia is one such animal. The cat was found in the streets of Istanbul. A(n) "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b8",
      "number": 8
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in her back legs had left her "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "paralyzed",
      "zh": "瘫痪的"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p7",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The cat had lived at a shelter for about a year before she caught Isa’s attention. Isa drew a picture of her that "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "captured",
      "ref": "v-capture"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " her charm. The artist encouraged her "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b9",
      "number": 9
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " to reach out and help Opia if they could."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p8",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "It was a "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b10",
      "number": 10
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " process, but Opia finally got her Disney dream come true and was adopted by a caring family!"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
